<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Feb prov forex reserves at $2.396 bln.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Feb prov forex reserves at $2.396 bln.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's foreign exchange reserves at the end of February were a provisional $2.396 billion, down 9.95 percent over the same period last year, the Central Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said forex reserves at the end of February last year were $2.661 billion.</p>
</text>
